d-0cf288926d1045f0","cmd-9f437bcc48094720","global:before_prepare:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete for node1: a healthy pre-restart state and boot identity were captured, the restart was acknowledged, the post-restart identity changed and agrees with the fixed lifecycle observations, and system health, SSH behavior, account state, and sudo policy recovered successfully.","limitations":["Fixed lifecycle probes do not inventory local accounts or sudoers, so those objects are independently observed only through executor commands after reboot.","The privilege-negative evidence covers group membership, the effective sudo policy, and representative authenticated denial tests, but does not audit every conceivable non-sudo privilege mechanism."]}
